cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Future B: Exact-corrected delayed acceptance and validation tools for first-principles diagrammatic Monte Carlo"
message: "This project is closed. Cite the software record and the upstream FEP-DMC paper separately."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wong
    given-names: Kawa
    alias: DarrenWongKaWa
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/DarrenWongKaWa/future-b"
abstract: >
  Closed methods study of exact-corrected analytic delayed acceptance
  (P1) in Luo EZ / Perturbo FEP-DMC for the LiF electron polaron.
  The public snapshot is a research archive (Python algebra, Fortran
  excerpts, frozen records). It does not ship the historical R1
  evaluator, a native one-click plugin, or a 1% ground-state result.
keywords:
  - diagrammatic Monte Carlo
  - electron-phonon
  - polaron
  - delayed acceptance
  - LiF
